## ⚡ Recommended Workflow (Urutan Eksekusi Task)

Setelah proyek selesai di-generate, ikuti alur eksekusi task standar berikut:

```text
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│  task setup  │ ──> │   task dev   │ ──> │   task fix   │ ──> │task check:all│
│(Init & Sync) │     │ (Development)│     │(Auto-format) │     │(Quality Gate)│
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘
```

### 1. Initialize Environment (Sekali di Awal)
```bash
# Trust konfigurasi lokal mise (jika menggunakan mise)
mise trust

# Inisialisasi .env dan install seluruh dependensi via uv sync
task setup
```

### 2. Run Local Development (Saat Coding)
{% if project_archetype == 'api-service' %}
```bash
# Jalankan FastAPI dev server dengan hot reload (port 8000)
task dev
```
Buka dokumentasi interaktif OpenAPI Swagger UI di: `http://localhost:8000/docs`
{% elif project_archetype == 'data-analytics' %}
```bash
# Buka lingkungan JupyterLab
task notebook

# Jalankan data pipeline extraction & transformation
task run
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'ai-ml' %}
```bash
# Jalankan model training loop
task train

# Jalankan model inference / evaluation
task eval
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'pipeline-worker' %}
```bash
# Jalankan background task worker
task worker
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'cli-tool' %}
```bash
# Jalankan tool CLI lokal
task run -- --help
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'library-package' %}
```bash
# Build paket wheel dan sdist
task build
```
{% endif %}

### 3. Format & Auto-Fix Code (Sebelum Commit)
```bash
# Merapikan formatting dan auto-fix isu linting dengan Ruff
task fix
```

### 4. Quality Gate & DevSecOps Verification (Wajib Lulus Sebelum Push)
```bash
# Menjalankan 5 quality gate sekaligus (Lint + Typecheck + Test + Bandit SAST + pip-audit)
task check:all
```

---

## 🛡 Quality Gate & Testing

Run all quality and security validations before committing changes:

```bash
# Check code formatting and linting
task lint

# Automatically fix format and autofixable lint issues
task fix

# Static type verification with Pyright
task typecheck

# Run test suite with Pytest & coverage report
task test

# Audit third-party dependencies for CVEs
task audit:deps

# Static Application Security Testing (SAST) via Bandit
task audit:sast

# Run all quality checks in a single pass
task check:all
```

